/target
Cargo.lock.orig
**/*.rs.bk

# RTK (Rust Token Killer) local tool state.
/.rtk

# mdbook rendered output (`mdbook build` / `just docs`; regenerate locally, don't commit).
/book/

# cargo-tarpaulin output (generated by `just coverage`; regenerate locally, don't commit).
/cobertura.xml
/tarpaulin-report.html

# Internal working docs — not part of the deliverable.
HANDOFF.md
handoff*.md

# Private-cloud bridge secrets + rendered artifacts — real creds/rendered configs must never be
# committed. Only the *.example template is tracked (distro/deploy/cloud.env.example).
cloud.env
*/cloud.env
cloud-relay.conf
*/cloud-relay.conf
mosquitto.d/
__pycache__/

# workspace-excluded hil/pico-seplos-emu (the HIL-bench Pico firmware) builds standalone too
/hil/pico-seplos-emu/target/

.claude/worktrees/

# Leftover west-managed checkouts from the retired Zephyr MCU path (bin/zephyr, EPIC #350 story
# #352) — never our source, and not deleted by the retirement (untracked local artifacts, possibly
# large); keep them hidden from `git status` rather than deleting a developer's local checkout.
/.west/
/zephyr/
/modules/
/tools/edtt
/tools/net-tools
